HISTORY Spextool FITS files contain an array of size                            HISTORY [nwaves,4,norders*naps]. The ith image (array[*,*,i]) contains          HISTORY the data for a single extraction aperture within an order such          HISTORY that, lambda=array[*,0,i], flux=array[*,1,i],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,i],flag=array[*,3,i].  The zeroth image           HISTORY (array[*,*,0]) contains the data for the aperture in the order          HISTORY closest to the bottom of the detector that is closest to the            HISTORY bottom of the slit (i.e. also closest to the bottom of the              HISTORY detector).  Moving up the detector, the FITS array is filled in         HISTORY with subsequent extraction apertures.  If no orders have been           HISTORY deselected in the extraction process, the contents of the ith           HISTORY aperture in order j can be found as follows:                            HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0157.fits, spectra0158.fits,          HISTORY spectra0159.fits, spectra0160.fits, spectra0161.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0162.fits, spectra0163.fits, spectra0164.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0165.fits, spectra0166.fits, spectra0181.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0182.fits, spectra0183.fits, spectra0184.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0185.fits, spectra0186.fits, spectra0187.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0188.fits, spectra0189.fits, spectra0190.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0247.fits, spectra0248.fits, spectra0249.fits,                   